# Repository layout

- `server/` — Spring Boot API only (Java 17, layered architecture)
- `dispensary/` — pharmacy ERP SPA (chemist staff)
- `admin/` — HQ CRM SPA (platform operators)

**Forbidden:** dispensary/admin importing server code directly. UIs call API via HTTP (`VITE_API_BASE_URL`).

## Backend layering

```
feature/ → application/ → persistence/ + domain/
```

Never skip `tenant_id` on queries. Package: `com.nammamedmate.server`.

## Environments

- Local: `compose.yaml` + `make up` — Postgres :25432, never RDS
- Prod: `compose.prod.yaml` on EC2 only — RDS + ElastiCache via `.env`

Never point Spring `local` profile at `rds.amazonaws.com`.
